flowchart TD
    U[Telegram Users] --> TG[Telegram Bot API]
    A[Authorized Operators] --> TG
    C[External Clients] -->|API Key + Rate Limit| HTTP[HTTP API]

    TG --> PRIMARY[Primary Controller Bot]
    PRIMARY --> UPD[Update Polling]
    UPD --> ROUTER[Command / Callback Router]
    ROUTER --> H[Handlers]
    H --> AUTHZ[Permission & Moderation Checks]
    AUTHZ --> ARCH[Archive Handlers]
    AUTHZ --> ADM[Admin Handlers]
    AUTHZ --> AIH[AI Handlers]
    AUTHZ --> FACTORYH[Bot Factory Commands]

    FACTORYH --> MANAGER[Bot Factory Manager]
    MANAGER --> VALIDATE[Telegram getMe Validation]
    MANAGER --> CIPHER[AES-256-GCM Token Encryption]
    MANAGER --> REG[(Managed Bot Registry)]
    MANAGER --> WORKERS[Isolated Managed Bot Workers]
    WORKERS -->|one token per stream| TG
    WORKERS --> METRICS[Health / Latency / Error Metrics]
    METRICS --> POLICY[Intelligent Routing Policy]

    HTTP --> APIAUTH[API Authentication]
    APIAUTH --> APIV1[API v1]
    APIAUTH --> APIV2[API v2 Bot Factory]
    APIV1 --> ARCH
    APIV2 --> MANAGER
    APIV2 --> POLICY
    APIV2 --> HEALTH[Health endpoints: healthz and v2 health]

    ARCH --> AS[Archive Service]
    ADM --> ADS[Admin & User Services]
    AIH --> AIGW[AI Gateway]
    APIV1 --> BUNDLE[Bundle Service]
    BUNDLE --> ZIP[Bounded ZIP Builder]
    AIGW --> LLM[OpenAI-Compatible Provider]

    AS --> DB[(MongoDB)]
    ADS --> DB
    BUNDLE --> DB
    MANAGER --> DB
    REG --> DB
    DB --> IDX[Indexes & Atomic Counters]

    AS --> TGA[Telegram File / Message API]
    BUNDLE --> TGA
    TGA --> TMP[/Bounded Temporary Files/]

